 "summary": "Logging library: loguru (migrated off structlog, Sept 2026)",
 "content": "The project moved off structlog to loguru (per user, ~late Sept 2026). Use loguru (`from loguru import logger`) in new/updated code; do not use structlog or the stdlib logging module. Migration is in progress: pyproject.toml and src/billing/invoices.py still reference structlog. Earlier convention (snake_case event keys, identifiers as keyword fields rather than in the message string) may still be wanted; confirm with the user.",
 "premise": "while the team standardizes on loguru",
 "invalidated_by": [
  "pyproject.toml"
 ]
}
